**`/app/answer.sql`** — a CTE aggregates Q4 2024 sales (`SUM(quantity * unit_price)`, `order_date >= 2024-10-01 AND < 2025-01-01`) per category/product, then `ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY category ORDER BY sales DESC, product_id)` picks the top 3 per category. It returns `category`, `product_id`, `sales`, so the groupby in your snippet works unchanged.

